@startuml scenario-AQA-2
!include plantuml-theme.puml
left to right direction
hide stereotype
title Quality attribute scenario — AQA-2 — Reliability / availability / fault tolerance
rectangle "<b>Source of stimulus</b>\nAWS infrastructure event" as SRC #E7E3F3
rectangle "<b>Stimulus</b>\nAvailability Zone eu-central-1a becomes impaired" as STIM #E7E3F3
rectangle "<b>Artifact</b>\nWhole environment — NAT Gateway, Redis node, Amazon MQ broker and OpenSearch node all sit in eu-central-1a" as ART #EDF2F8
rectangle "<b>Response</b>\nBrowse and cart keep working from eu-central-1b/c; checkout degrades with a clear message; no committed order lost" as RESP #E4F0E9
rectangle "<b>Response measure</b>\nProposed — confirm: browse + cart restored within 5 min; 0 committed orders lost" as MEAS #E4F0E9
rectangle "<b>Environment</b>\nNormal operation, shoppers active" as ENV #F5EEE3
SRC  --> STIM : generates
STIM --> ART  : arrives at
ART  --> RESP : produces
RESP --> MEAS : measured by
ENV  ..> ART
@enduml
